# `Work.SeedCertRay.DataAll` — the emitted certificate data (generated)

All numbers are mantissas at scale `2 ^ 40` (`Work.SeedCertRay.MSZ`).  `PXM`/`PYM` are the centre
of the parameter box, `RADM = MSZ * X.rad` its radius bound; `dsk k` lists the ten-fold `NC`
sub-disks of level `k` (angle-major), `crt k` the certificate triples `(s, rho, M)` of the steps
out of level `k`, `dirs k` the ten half-plane directions of level `k`, `dirBase` the ten base
directions (the level-0 centres are `lvl0mid i * q_j`), and `lvl0mid`, `lvl0rad` the level-0
data.
